            </div>
            <p style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); max-width: 800px; margin: 20px auto;">A Green Card (U.S. Permanent Residence) allows you to live and work permanently in the United States. This guide covers all employment‑based categories (EB‑1, EB‑2, EB‑3, EB‑4, EB‑5), the PERM labor certification process, priority dates, adjustment of status, and consular processing.</p>
